    "The inventory excludes .so and extensionless executable/test binaries, sources, logs, build directories, incremental directories, fingerprints, g4-009/g4-011/g4-012 and their dependency seeds.",
    "Statistics describe the stated observation time, not future deletion safety or current free space."
  ]
}
